            "review_title": "Review at Zumwhere Nguyễn Trãi",
            "review_text": "Catherine\n15 contributions\n0\nCozy spot to relax!!\nMar 2026 • Friends\nZumwhere is a nice spot to relax and unwind. The space feels cozy and laid-back, great for hanging out or getting some work done. Drinks were decent, and my favorite was the roast duck with truffle and caviar - definitely worth trying. The overall atmosphere was very comfortable.\nWritten April 10, 2026",
